ffers a wide array of undergraduate, postgraduate, and doctoral programs across various disciplines, fostering a culture of scholarly pursuits among its diverse student population.\\n\\nThe campus is spread across 87 acres, providing an environment conducive to holistic development. With a strong emphasis on research and innovation, the institution hosts various research centres and an incubation cell to nurture entrepreneurial skills. Students benefit from an experienced faculty, state-of-the-art laboratory facilities, and a robust library system that supports extensive academic research. The college''s commitment to quality education is matched by its emphasis on moral and ethical values, preparing students to be responsible citizens.\\n\\nPlacement records at Jamal Mohamed College are impressive, with top companies visiting the campus annually to recruit bright graduates. The institution has strong industry linkages, facilitating internships, project work, and industry-sponsored research. Its legacy of producing distinguished alumni who excel in various fields, from civil services to corporate leadership, makes it one of the most sought-after colleges in the region.","highlights":["A++ NAAC Accreditation","Golden Jubilee Campus","Diverse Research Centers","Active NCC and NSS Units","Strong Placement Cell","Smart Classrooms","Language Labs","Incubation Centre","State-of-the-art Sports Complex","Vibrant Student Life"],"departments":[{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy