ation centre—the institute offers specialized post-graduate M.Sc. and Ph.D. programs in Microbiology, Virology, Immunology, and Diagnostics. \\n\\nWith heritage architecture combined with advanced laboratory setups, the institution offers unmatched research exposure, producing elite scientists, microbiologists, and public health experts who lead healthcare innovations globally.","highlights":["Historic institution established in 1899/1941","WHO authorized international vaccination centre","Major producer of biologicals and anti-snake venom","Advanced research labs in virology and bacteriology","Direct affiliation with Dr. M.G.R. Medical University","Extensive publication record in international journals","Eminent faculty comprising senior medical scientists","Specialized postgraduate and doctoral research focus","State-of-the-art reference diagnostic laboratories","Strong placement in research labs and pharma industries"],"departments":[{"name":"Microbiology & Immunology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Virology & Diagnostics","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Innovation Cell"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Digital Learning Centre"}],"placementRate":90,"avgPackage":"6.0 LPA","highestPackage":"12.0 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Notification","desc":"Announcement of admissions by medical university/institute."},{"title":"Application","desc":"Online submission of applications with science degree transcripts."},{"title":"Entrance Examination","desc":"Clearing the specialized medical entrance test."},{"title":"C