ing, and holistic development. Affiliated with the University of Madras and granted autonomous status, DGVC offers a comprehensive portfolio of undergraduate, postgraduate, and research programs across diverse disciplines including arts, science, commerce, and management.\\n\\nThe sprawling campus is equipped with modern state-of-the-art infrastructure, advanced laboratories, a well-stocked central library, and digital learning facilities. The faculty comprises highly qualified, experienced, and dedicated educators who employ innovative pedagogical techniques to foster critical thinking and practical problem-solving skills among students. Emphasizing research, entrepreneurship, and community engagement, DGVC encourages students to participate in various extracurricular, cocurricular, and outreach activities.\\n\\nWith a robust placement cell that collaborates closely with industry leaders, the institution consistently achieves impressive placement records, bridging the gap between academia and corporate requirements. DG Vaishnav College continues to uphold its founding vision of delivering quality education rooted in traditional values while adapting dynamically to the modern global landscape.","highlights":["Autonomous institution affiliated with the University of Madras","Accredited with NAAC A+ Grade","Sprawling 10-acre eco-friendly campus in the heart of Chennai","More than 45 diverse undergraduate and postgraduate programs","State-of-the-art computer labs and research facilities","Dedicated placement cell with top-tier corporate recruiters","Active student clubs fostering cultural and technical skills","Robust Industry-Academia interface and MoUs","Extensive library with digital resources and e-journals","Strong alumni network holding prominent positions globally"],"departments":[{"name":"Department of Computer Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Department of Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Department of Business Administration","level":"PG"},{"name":"Departmen