wer, To Change, To Live.\\" Dedicated to the upliftment of rural women, the college has grown into one of the highest-graded self-financing institutions affiliated with Bharathidasan University, achieving a NAAC ''A++'' accreditation in its second assessment cycle — a distinction unmatched among self-financing colleges affiliated with the university.\\n\\nSpread across a serene, plastic-free 16-acre green campus, the college offers 20 undergraduate, 12 postgraduate, 5 M.Phil., and 4 Ph.D. programmes, complemented by numerous certificate and vocational courses designed to build employability alongside academic knowledge. The institution''s ISO 21001:2018 certification reflects its structured approach to educational quality management.\\n\\nBeyond the classroom, Bon Secours emphasises rural outreach and women''s empowerment as core institutional values, in keeping with its founding mission. Its NIRF recognition in the 151-200 band places it among the more prominent women''s colleges in the Cauvery Delta region, drawing students from across Thanjavur and neighbouring districts.","highlights":["Established in 2002 by the Franciscan Sisters of Our Lady of Bon Secours","NAAC ''A++'' Grade (CGPA 3.71) — Highest in Category","Autonomous Status from 2024-25","Affiliated to Bharathidasan University","ISO 21001:2018 Certified Institution","NIRF Ranked (Band 151-200, 2022)","16-Acre Eco-Friendly Green Campus","20 UG, 12 PG, 5 M.Phil. & 4 Ph.D. Programmes","191 Value-Added Certificate Courses","Focus on Rural Women''s Empowerment"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc.","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com.","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A.","level":"UG"},{"name":"BBA","level":"UG"},{"name":"BCA","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.L.I.S.","level":"UG"},{"name":"MBA","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Wi-Fi Campus"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Labs"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Health Centre"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Research Centre"}],"placementRate":55,"avgPackage":"≈₹70,000","highestPackage":"≈₹2.5 LPA    ","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Online/Offline Registration","desc":"Submit application through the college office or website."},{"title":"Merit-Based Selection","desc":"Selection based on qualifying examination marks."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Original certificates verified at the time of admission."},{"title":"Fee Payment","desc":"Admission confirmed upon payment of fees."}],"scholarships":["UGC-Recognized Institutional Scholarships","Rural Women Empowerment Scholarships","Merit-Based Fee Concessions"],"events":["College Day","Women''s Empowerment Week","IQAC Seminars","Cultural Fest","Community Outreach Camps"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"Convenient access","railway":"Convenient access","bustand":"Well connected","metro":"N/A","hospital":"Medical facilities available"},"hostelFeatures":[],"technicalClubs":["IQAC Innovation Cell","Computer Science Association"],"culturalClubs":["Fine Arts Club","Literary Association"],"communityService":["NSS","Rural Women Upliftment Programme","Eco-Friendly Campus Initiative","Community Outreach"]}'),
