riyar Maniammai Institute of Science & - CollegeShine","description":"Periyar Maniammai Institute of Science & Technology is a private (deemed university) engineering college in Vallam, Thanjavur established in 1988. Think.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Periyar-Maniammai-Institute-of-Science-and-Technology_6_11zon-300x300.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Periyar Maniammai Institute of Science & - CollegeShine","description":"Periyar Maniammai Institute of Science & Technology is a private (deemed university) engineering college in Vallam, Thanjavur established in 1988. Think.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Periyar-Maniammai-Institute-of-Science-and-Technology_6_11zon-300x300.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Periyar Maniammai Institute of Science & Technology","shortName":"PMIST","tagline":"Think, Innovate, Transform","category":"engineering","type":"Deemed-to-be University","ownership":"Private (Deemed University)","established":1988,"location":"Vallam, Thanjavur","district":"Thanjavur","address":"Periyar Nagar, Vallam, Thanjavur, Tamil Nadu 613403","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Periyar+Maniammai+Institute+of+Science+and+Technology+Vallam+Thanjavur","mapQuery":"Periyar+Maniammai+Institute+of+Science+and+Technology+Vallam+Thanjavur","website":"https://www.pmu.edu/","phone":"+91 4362 264600","email":"admission@pmu.edu","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Periyar-Maniammai-Institute-of-Science-and-Technology_6_11zon-300x300.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F6NGDFQooa4?si=obdSCwDK-c0Zr8WJ","affiliation":"Deemed-to-be University (UGC)","accreditation":["UGC Recognized Deemed-to-be University","NAAC Accredited","AICTE Approved","NBA Accredited Programmes","COA Approved Architecture Programme","NCTE Recognized Education Programmes"],"about":"Periyar Maniammai Institute of Science & Technology (PMIST) traces its origin to 1988, when it was established as Periyar Maniammai College of Technology for Women. The institution was created in the pioneering tradition of providing technical education for women and was named in honour of Thanthai Periyar E.V. Ramasamy and Annai Maniammaiyar. Located at Vallam in Thanjavur district, the university now occupies a 114.85-acre campus designed as an energy-efficient, environmentally responsible and student-focused academic environment.\\n\\nPMIST was granted Deemed-to-be University status in 2007 and has developed into a multidisciplinary institution offering programmes in engineering, architecture, computing sciences, science, humanities, education, management and related disciplines. The university currently promotes new-age programmes and specialisations including Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, Data Science, Cyber Security, Electric Vehicles, Energy Engineering, Robotics and Industrial Automation, along with new programmes introduced for 2026-27.\\n\\nThe university supports academic development through the Arjun Singh Library, digital learning resources, laboratories, research centres, an IPR Cell, funded research projects, industry interaction and placement activities. The official PMIST website reports 93,097 books, 308 journals, 2,263 digital-library resources and 2,780 dissertations. The campus also provides separate hostels, 24-hour hospital support, Wi-Fi connectivity, sports facilities and sustainability initiatives. Its stated motto is ''Think, Innovate, Transform''.","highlights":["Established in 1988","Deemed-to-be University Status Since 2007","114.85-Acre Campus","Located at Vallam, Thanjavur","Pioneer in Women''s Technical Education","93,097 Books","308 Journals","2,263 Digital Library Resources","2,780 Dissertations","100+ Placement Recruiters","₹15 LPA Highest Reported CTC","₹10 LPA Average Reported CTC"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Arch.","level":"PhD"},{"name":"B.Tech. Civil Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech. Mechanical Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech. Electronics & Communication Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech. Electrical & Electronics Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech. Aerospace Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech. Biotechnology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech. Computer Science & Engineering","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech. Information Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"BCA","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com.","level":"UG"},{"name":"BBA","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Ed.","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. Tamil","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. English","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. Journalism & Mass Communication","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. Political Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Chemistry","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Physics","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.A. English","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.A. Tamil","level":"PG"},{"name":"MBA","level":"PG"},{"name":"MCA","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Computer Science & Engineering","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Construction Engineering & Management","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Energy Engineering","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Structural Engineering","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Biotechnology","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Tech. Embedded Systems","level":"PG"},{"name":"Ph.D. Civil Engineering","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Ph.D. Mechanical Engineering","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Ph.D. Computer Science & Engineering","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Ph.D. Biotechnology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Ph.D. Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Ph.D. Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Ph.D. Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Ph.D. English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"B.Sc. Film & TV Production","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Renewable Energy","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com. FinTech & AI","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech. CSE with AI & ML","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Tech. CSE with Data Science"