lished in 1955. Learning Promotes.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rajah-Serfoji-Government-Arts-College_8_11zon.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Rajah Serfoji Government College (Autonomous) - CollegeShine","description":"Rajah Serfoji Government College (Autonomous) is a government arts & science college in Near New Bus Stand, Thanjavur established in 1955. Learning Promotes.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rajah-Serfoji-Government-Arts-College_8_11zon.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Rajah Serfoji Government College (Autonomous)","shortName":"RSGC Thanjavur","tagline":"Learning Promotes Natural Talent","category":"arts-science","type":"Government Arts and Science College","ownership":"Government","established":1955,"location":"Near New Bus Stand, Thanjavur","district":"Thanjavur","address":"Rajah Serfoji Government College, Near New Bus Stand, Thanjavur, Tamil Nadu 613005","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Rajah+Serfoji+Government+College+Thanjavur","mapQuery":"Rajah Serfoji Government College Thanjavur","website":"https://www.rsgc.ac.in/","phone":"+91 4362-226417","email":"tnjrsgc@yahoo.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Rajah-Serfoji-Government-Arts-College_8_11zon.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ","affiliation":"Affiliated to Bharathidasan University, Tiruchirappalli","accreditation":["NAAC ''A'' Grade","DST-FIST Institution","UGC Recognized","Autonomous Institution","Bharathidasan University Affiliated"],"about":"Rajah Serfoji Government College (Autonomous), Thanjavur was established in 1955 with the vision of providing quality higher education to students from all sections of society, particularly socially and economically disadvantaged students in the Thanjavur and Cauvery Delta region. The institution was initially started in the Sangeetha Mahal of the Thanjavur Palace Complex and later moved to its permanent campus. The college became a Government institution in 1965 and attained autonomous status in 2004.\\n\\nThe college is affiliated to Bharathidasan University, Tiruchirappalli and is recognised with NAAC ''A'' Grade and DST-FIST status. The institution currently offers programmes across Science, Humanities, Commerce and Business Administration, including undergraduate, postgraduate, M.Phil. and Ph.D. programmes. The official college profile states 22 UG, 14 PG, 9 M.Phil. and 20 Ph.D. programmes, while the official 2023-24 AQAR reports 47 programmes during that academic year. The campus includes 44 acres of land, 107 classrooms, 20 laboratories and 4 seminar halls.\\n\\nThe institution supports academic development through its central library and 13 departmental libraries, digital learning resources, Computer Literacy Programme, research facilities, mentoring, career guidance, NSS, NCC, Youth Red Cross, sports, cultural activities and student welfare schemes. The college''s mission places strong emphasis on inclusive higher education, research aptitude, employability and holistic student development.","highlights":["Established in 1955","Autonomous Government College","NAAC ''A'' Grade Institution","DST-FIST Institution","Affiliated to Bharathidasan University","NIRF 2025 College Rank #79","4,753 Students Reported in AQAR 2023-24","47 Programmes Reported in AQAR 2023-24","44 Acre Campus","20 Laboratories","70,000+ Library Books","13 Departmental Libraries","22 UG Programmes","14 PG Programmes","9 M.Phil Programmes","20 Ph.D Programmes","Tamil and English Medium Courses","Computer Literacy Programme","Strong Research Infrastructure","Inclusive Student Support System"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Economics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"History","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Zoology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Botany","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Biochemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Statistics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Biotechnology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Business Administration","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Centre"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Science Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Ground"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Auditorium"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Support"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Career & Counselling Cell"},{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Internet & Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-laptop","name":"Digital Library"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Laboratory"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facilities"}],"placementRate":"Unlisted","avgPackage":"Unlisted","highestPackage":"Unlisted","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Online Registration","desc":"Candidates register through the official college admission process and submit the required academic and personal information."},{"title":"Eligibility Verification","desc":"Applications are checked against the eligibility requirements prescribed for the selected undergraduate or postgraduate programme."},{"title":"Rank List","desc":"Eligible applicants are considered according to qualifying marks, Government reservation rules and the autonomous college admission procedure."},{"title":"Counselling","desc":"Candidates included in the rank list participate in department-wise counselling and seat allotment."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Original academic, community, transfer and other required certificates are verified during admission."},{"title":"Fee Payment","desc":"Selected candidates complete the prescribed admission fee and institutional formali